  <section class="section-case-detail section-xs pb-0">
    <div class="theme-h-line theme-outerline-left theme-outerline-right"></div>
    <div class="custom-container-1840">
      <div class="case-detail-layout">
        <!-- Left Side - Sticky -->
        <div class="case-detail-left section-xs theme-padding-xs">
          <div class="section-title">
            <h2 class="line-reveal">The Client</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="client-desc line-reveal">
            <p>
              With the increasing demand for its services, the “city children
              hospital” recognised the need to establish an online presence to
              connect with the community and attract more patients. The hospital
              also wanted to provide online booking for appointments and
              facilitate secure communication between patients and healthcare
              providers.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Side - Scrollable -->
        <div class="case-detail-right">
          <div class="case-detail-block section-xs theme-padding-xs">
            <h3 class="case-detail-heading line-reveal">Core Requirements</h3>
            <div class="mocup-img">
              <picture>
                <img
                  src={`${imagesurl}case-study/all-case-study/dynageeksllc/edition.webp`}
                  alt="Core Requirements"
                  width="350"
                  height="410"
                />
              </picture>
            </div>
            <ul class="list-point">
              <li>
                Develop a website that reflects the brand and values of
                Dynageeks LLC.
              </li>
              <li>
                Making the website more intuitive for users to find the
                information they require.
              </li>
              <li>
                Increase the visibility of websites on search engines by
                implementing best seo practices.
              </li>
              <li>
                Fully responsive website accessible on any devices, including
                mobile devices.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-footer section-xs pt-0">
    <div class="theme-h-line theme-outerline-left"></div>
    <div class="container custom-container-1840">
      <div class="contact-us-title section-xs pb-0">
